Hosting
Vercel
Builds with Vite, serves the app over HTTPS and runs the API route
Request Flow
• Step 1: The user opens the Vercel URL and the React app loads from the Vite build.
• Step 2: The app reads saved missions, transactions and profile data from localStorage.
• Step 3: The user creates a savings mission or adds a transaction; the state updates and the data is written back to localStorage.
• Step 4: The dashboard KPIs and analytics recalculate and re-render immediately.
• Step 5: When AI insights are requested, the app sends the savings progress, goals and recent transactions to the AI layer.
• Step 6: The Gemini API returns an analysis, which is displayed inside the application as actionable guidance.
